            "level": {
                "value": 1
            },
            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>Kirakors are well-dressed fey musicians, performers, and ambassadors, and as such are often the first fey many commonfolk ever meet. They have a strong sense of conscience and an even greater sense of style, using their dazzling looks to defuse situations before they devolve into combat. However, when fights happen, they stand firm against injustice, even when it's bigger than they are. Kirakors look like bipedal crickets with a full head of humanoid-like hair.</p><hr /><p>Elusive, flighty, and ebullient, sprites are what many villagers first imagine when they hear the terms \"fey\" or \"fairy.\"</p>",
            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Pathfinder Feybound"
            }
